&lt;p&gt;Lightning AI is looking to hire &lt;strong&gt;AI&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Platform Support Engineers &lt;/strong&gt;to join our EMEA Customer Experience team, supporting ML engineers running large-scale training and inference workloads across cloud infrastructure, Kubernetes, and GPU platforms in production environments.&lt;/p&gt;
