&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nhc2mt&quot; data-start=&quot;455&quot; data-end=&quot;555&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;457&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;Flexible Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlimited PTO, company holidays, and floating holidays to support work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
