&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track all on-site assets, including inbound and outbound shipments; maintain accurate records within inventory systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records within inventory systems. Contribute to systems, tooling, reporting insights or improve processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document full asset lifecycle (procurement → deployment → disposal) and own data integrity for asset records and system usage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular audits across multiple tracking systems; identify and implement process and reporting improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve ambiguous/non-routine problems independently, escalating when necessary; drive root-cause fixes and follow-up actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee maintenance, upgrades, decommissioning, and disposal with procedural compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain documentation for asset processes and procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parts &amp;amp; Inventory Administration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
