&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams to maintain appropriate stock levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate RMAs with vendors and manage escalations to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as go-to expert/mentor for Asset related issues at location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
