&lt;li&gt;Package and coordinate outbound shipments with delivery partners; maintain detailed shipping records and ensure successful deliveries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and securely store incoming hardware with ownership of chain-of-custody documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access &amp;amp; Vendor Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage physical and system access via internal data center portals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approve vendor and third-party access requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with on-site vendors to ensure project completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle RMA escalations and communicate with Operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the IT Asset Manager, Data Center Technicians, and Site Manager to align on company-wide asset standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with company-wide asset management standards and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
