&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12lc0uc&quot; data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1184&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1039&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Think Long-Term:&lt;/strong&gt; We design for what&#39;s next. We create scalable systems, simplify complexity, and use AI and automation to amplify our impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_actions__container c-message__actions&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building an AI-native company, which means the way we hire, grow, and support our people has to move as fast as our product. We&#39;re looking for a Senior People Partner to embed with our engineering and technical leadership, a strategic thinker who makes org design, talent decisions, and complex people moments feel clear instead of chaotic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a purely advisory seat. You&#39;ll own high-stakes situations end-to-end, from a tricky leveling call to a sensitive exit, while also building the muscle and systems that let our technical leaders make great people decisions on their own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a small, high-leverage People team where your judgment shapes how a fast-scaling, distributed engineering and Neocloud org actually works. If you love being close to the technical org, translating ambiguity into structure, and being trusted with the hard stuff, this is your seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with technical leaders to drive clear, consistent calls on org design, team structure, leveling, promotions, and comp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex employee relations and performance situations end-to-end: coaching leaders through performance management, role transitions, and exits with care and rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level up manager capability across the technical org: sharper feedback, better performance conversations, stronger talent decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent to raise the bar on hiring quality: role design, leveling frameworks, and evaluation practices for technical roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot friction and risk in people processes before they become problems, and build pragmatic, scalable fixes alongside Legal, Total Rewards, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in People Partnering or HRBP roles, with real depth partnering directly with engineering or technical orgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of influencing senior technical leaders on org design, performance, and talent decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp employee relations judgment and a demonstrated ability to own and resolve high-stakes, complex situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving comp, promotion, and leveling decisions in technical environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting globally distributed technical teams and navigating multi-country complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder&#39;s instinct for ambiguity, comfortable moving fast while creating practical structure and clarity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and influencing skills with senior, highly technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to international employment models or global expansion work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with career frameworks and compensation models for engineering orgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or evolving people systems inside a scaling, AI-native or deep-tech company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting globally distributed engineering organizations specifically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SPHR or comparable certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing or improving compliance-focused programs that measurably reduce organizational risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are committed to offering competitive compensation that reflects the value each team member brings to our mission. Final offers are based on factors such as experience, skills, geographic location, and role expectations. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package for eligible roles includes a discretionary bonus, a meaningful equity component, and comprehensive benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The anticipated annual base salary range for this role is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
