&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vkpt18&quot; data-start=&quot;319&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;321&quot; data-end=&quot;343&quot;&gt;Move with Urgency:&lt;/strong&gt; We move quickly, make thoughtful decisions, and keep momentum. We value action over perfection and learn by shipping.&lt;/li&gt;
