&lt;p&gt;Multiple position openings. We’re looking for a Senior Software Engineer who will design and implement microservices-based architecture for Lightning AI&#39;s core platform services. Position allows for occasional telecommuting within commuting distance of reporting office in San Francisco, CA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain RESTful APIs and backend services for resource management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop internal tools and automation for infrastructure provisioning;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate with various cloud provider services (AWS, Azure, GCP);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design decisions and architecture planning;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code and provide constructive feedback to team members;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior software engineers and promote software engineering best practices;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical planning and sprint planning sessions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement monitoring, logging, and alerting solutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot production issues and implement fixes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop disaster recovery and backup strategies; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize system performance and resource utilization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position requires a Bachelor’s degree in Software or Computer Engineering, Computer Science or a closely related technical field (or foreign degree equivalent); and 5 years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Position also requires at least five (5) years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering with a focus on backend/distributed systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with cloud platforms such as AWS, GCP, and/or Azure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with container orchestration (Kubernetes) and microservices architecture;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming languages such as Go, Python, and/or Java;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure-as-code such as Terraform and/or CloudFormation; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking, security, and scalability concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
