&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Position also requires at least five (5) years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software engineering with a focus on backend/distributed systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with cloud platforms such as AWS, GCP, and/or Azure;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with container orchestration (Kubernetes) and microservices architecture;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programming languages such as Go, Python, and/or Java;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure-as-code such as Terraform and/or CloudFormation; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking, security, and scalability concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
